{"seq":3,"slug":"vae-fundamentals","title":"VAE 基础原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/gan-and-vae/vae-fundamentals","wordCount":1369,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"vae-基础原理\">VAE 基础原理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>变分自编码器（Variational Autoencoder, VAE）是一种基于概率图模型的生成框架，由 Kingma 和 Welling 在 2013 年提出。VAE 将生成过程建模为隐变量模型：数据 x 由隐变量 z 通过解码器 p<em>θ(x|z) 生成，隐变量服从先验分布 p(z)。由于真实后验 p(z|x) 不可解析，VAE 引入编码器 q</em>φ(z|x) 作为近似后验，并通过最大化证据下界（ELBO）同时训练编码器和解码器。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    X[输入 x] --&gt; ENC[编码器 q_φ]&#10;    ENC --&gt; MU[均值 μ]&#10;    ENC --&gt; SIGMA[方差 σ²]&#10;    MU --&gt; Z[隐变量 z]&#10;    SIGMA --&gt; Z&#10;    Z --&gt; DEC[解码器 p_θ]&#10;    DEC --&gt; XHAT[重构 x̂]&#10;    PRIOR[先验 p_z] -.-&gt; Z\">graph LR\n    X[输入 x] --&gt; ENC[编码器 q_φ]\n    ENC --&gt; MU[均值 μ]\n    ENC --&gt; SIGMA[方差 σ²]\n    MU --&gt; Z[隐变量 z]\n    SIGMA --&gt; Z\n    Z --&gt; DEC[解码器 p_θ]\n    DEC --&gt; XHAT[重构 x̂]\n    PRIOR[先验 p_z] -.-&gt; Z</pre><p>VAE 的核心创新在于将变分推断与深度学习无缝结合。编码器和解码器都是深度神经网络，通过重参数化技巧使得随机采样过程可微分，从而支持端到端的梯度优化。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>VAE</th>\n<th>AE（自编码器）</th>\n<th>GAN</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生成能力</td>\n<td>有（从先验采样）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有（从噪声生成）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐空间结构</td>\n<td>正则化连续</td>\n<td>无约束</td>\n<td>隐式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练目标</td>\n<td>ELBO（重构+KL）</td>\n<td>重构误差</td>\n<td>对抗损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练稳定性</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>密度估计</td>\n<td>可近似</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型问题</td>\n<td>生成模糊</td>\n<td>过拟合</td>\n<td>模式崩塌</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"elbo-优化与训练实践\">ELBO 优化与训练实践</h2><p>ELBO = E<em>q[log p</em>θ(x|z)] - KL(q<em>φ(z|x) || p(z)) 包含两项：重构损失鼓励解码器从隐变量准确还原输入数据，KL 散度正则项约束编码器输出的后验分布接近标准高斯先验。当 q</em>φ(z|x) = N(μ, σ²I) 且 p(z) = N(0, I) 时，KL 散度有闭式解：KL = -½ Σ(1 + log σ² - μ² - σ²)。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;import torch.nn.functional as F&#10;&#10;class ConvVAE(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, latent_dim=256, img_channels=3):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.encoder = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Conv2d(img_channels, 32, 4, 2, 1), nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Conv2d(32, 64, 4, 2, 1), nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Conv2d(64, 128, 4, 2, 1), nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Conv2d(128, 256, 4, 2, 1), nn.ReLU(),&#10;        )&#10;        self.fc_mu = nn.Linear(256 * 4 * 4, latent_dim)&#10;        self.fc_logvar = nn.Linear(256 * 4 * 4, latent_dim)&#10;        self.fc_decode = nn.Linear(latent_dim, 256 * 4 * 4)&#10;        self.decoder = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.ConvTranspose2d(256, 128, 4, 2, 1), nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.ConvTranspose2d(128, 64, 4, 2, 1), nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.ConvTranspose2d(64, 32, 4, 2, 1), nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.ConvTranspose2d(32, img_channels, 4, 2, 1), nn.Sigmoid(),&#10;        )&#10;&#10;    def encode(self, x):&#10;        h = self.encoder(x).flatten(1)&#10;        return self.fc_mu(h), self.fc_logvar(h)&#10;&#10;    def reparameterize(self, mu, logvar):&#10;        std = torch.exp(0.5 * logvar)&#10;        return mu + std * torch.randn_like(std)&#10;&#10;    def decode(self, z):&#10;        h = self.fc_decode(z).view(-1, 256, 4, 4)&#10;        return self.decoder(h)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        mu, logvar = self.encode(x)&#10;        z = self.reparameterize(mu, logvar)&#10;        return self.decode(z), mu, logvar&#10;&#10;def elbo_loss(recon, target, mu, logvar, beta=1.0):&#10;    recon_loss = F.mse_loss(recon, target, reduction=&#39;sum&#39;)&#10;    kl_loss = -0.5 * torch.sum(1 + logvar - mu.pow(2) - logvar.exp())&#10;    return recon_loss + beta * kl_loss\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn.functional </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConvVAE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, latent_dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, img_channels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"